Package: reach.postproc
Title: Flood Forecast Error Post-Processing
Version: 0.7.6
Authors@R: person("Jonathan", "Payne", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jonathan.payne@example.org")
Description: Transparent autoregressive and autoregressive moving-average
    post-processing for flood forecasts. Provides characteristic-root analysis,
    Environment Agency parameter assessment, fixed lead-time evaluation,
    diagnostics, scoring, and presentation-ready plots.
